# Game loop architecture (pointer)

Full draft: [`docs/docs/architecture/game-loop.md`](../../docs/docs/architecture/game-loop.md).

**Summary:** A Station owns its Hab + Hangar. Hab/Hangar are per-player instances
(placeable build; team can follow in). On foot: Hab ↔ Station (`scene-exit`) →
AVMS call ship / To Hangar → Hangar. Ships: Open Space **`enter-station`** →
Hangar; Hangar **`exit-hangar`** → station nested `hangar-open-space-exit` in
Open Space. See also [Space traversal](../../docs/docs/architecture/space-traversal.md).

When changing station/hab/hangar/AVMS/`scene-exit`/boarding flow, read the full
doc first. Also listed in `AGENTS.md`.
